# API base URL. Leave empty when the web host proxies /api and /uploads
# to the backend on the same public origin. Otherwise set the backend origin.
# Cross-site API deployments require HTTPS and may still be blocked as third-party
# cookies in private browsing; a same-origin reverse proxy is the reliable setup.
